sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant AP as AddWordsPanel
    participant PF as lib/parseForms
    participant DL as lib/dict
    participant SWA as cloud/stationWords
    participant GA as cloud/generate
    participant FN as Edge Function generate-word
    participant DC as dict_cache
    participant DS as DeepSeek
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>AP: 粘贴 "photosynthesis, quixotic; obtuse"
    AP->>PF: parse(raw)
    PF-->>AP: ParsedForm[]（去重/去空）
    AP->>DL: lookupForms(forms)
    DL-->>AP: hit / miss 分组
    Note over AP: 预览：命中 ✓ / 待生成 ⚡ / 站内重复 ⚠

    U->>AP: 勾选并提交
    AP->>SWA: addMany(stationId, hitItems)
    SWA->>DB: upsert station_words(source='public')
    DB-->>SWA: ok（ignoreDuplicates 跳过重复）

    AP->>GA: generate(['photosynthesis','quixotic'], stationId)
    GA->>FN: POST /generate-word（Bearer JWT）
    FN->>FN: auth.getUser(token) → uid
    FN->>DC: select form_key in (...)
    DC-->>FN: 公共库命中 / 生成缓存命中
    alt 缓存未命中
        FN->>FN: consume_generation_quota(n)
        FN->>DS: POST /chat/completions（批量，禁音标）
        DS-->>FN: items[]
        FN->>FN: 校验字段；丢弃音标；morphs 兜底 x.unk
        FN->>DC: upsert dict_cache(payload, model, prompt_version)
    end
    FN->>DB: upsert user_words（音标取自 dict_cache）
    FN->>DB: upsert station_words(source='user')
    FN-->>GA: results + quota
    GA-->>AP: 逐词状态（onProgress）
    AP->>SWA: refresh
    AP-->>U: 已加入 18 词 · 新生成 2 词 · 跳过 1 重复
